Upstream's script headers (util-iso.sh, util-msg.sh, util-iso-mount.sh, lddd.sh) say "version 2 of the License", with no "or
later", while the repository's LICENSE file is GPL v3. Which one governs is for counsel.

Everything else (the build orchestration, the rendering, the identity writer, the verifier, the tests, the first-boot
